Not worth it with a limited budget:
- EXPLAIN and EXPLAIN QUERY PLAN output (most of the visible failures; the exact VDBE listing would have to be reproduced);
- page_count and freelist_count values;
- UPDATE/INSERT on sqlite_master with writable_schema on;
- 'database or disk is full' limits;
- a reference random byte (randomblob(0) - 1).
All of these remained failing at 94.30%.
